              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रवक्ता — pravaktā — \"a spokesman\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रवक्ता सभायां वदति। pravaktā sabhāyāṃ vadati. The spokesman speaks at the meeting."
            },
