          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रवक्ता (pravaktā) is built from pra, \"forth\", and vaktṛ, \"a speaker\", from the root √vac, \"to speak\"; MW gives pravaktṛ as one who tells or relates, an announcer, and a spokesman is its modern use (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
